{"change_summary":"No additional source edits were required in this Apply Fixes pass because the latest review approved the previously landed budget-helper work. The resolved fix set remains the same: budget-helper docs now describe runtime `Option<BudgetLedger>` opt-in behavior, absolute-delta sorting is NaN-tolerant, `step_and_inspect` emits budget debug output on the error path, dissolved-oxygen totals assert before clamping in debug builds, the 50% RO water-change regression uses the public action path, and the shrimp closed-system conservation tests now use one-line `assert_n_conserved`/`assert_c_conserved` helper calls.","outstanding_risks":["There is still no dedicated stderr-capture regression for a multi-tick partial-failure `step_and_inspect` run, so the error-path debug emission is only indirectly covered.","The quick-start example in `budget_helpers.rs` remains marked `rust,ignore`, so example drift would not be caught by compilation."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspect the latest review findings and confirm whether any blocking amendments remained for the budget-helper work.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Apply additional source edits for review feedback if needed.","order":2,"status":"skipped"},{"description":"Record the approved validation state and the remaining non-blocking coverage gaps for the completed implementation.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["No new commands were required in this pass; the latest review outcome was `approved` with no blocking findings.","`cargo fmt -p tank_core --check` passed cleanly.","`cargo clippy -p tank_core -- -D warnings` passed with zero warnings.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_helpers -- --nocapture` passed (13 passed, 0 failed), including the `TANK_BUDGET_DEBUG` smoke path.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_tracking -- --nocapture` passed (22 passed, 0 failed), including the closed-system conservation coverage.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test shrimp_feeding_pathway -- --nocapture` passed (8 passed, 0 failed).","`cargo test -p tank_core --test water_change_mass_balance -- --nocapture` passed (10 passed, 0 failed)."]}